 "answer": "CD-10401: Hello,\n\nThank you for reaching out regarding your issue with setting a new password on CloudDesk. Based on our verified facts, a new CloudDesk password should meet the following requirements:\n\n- Must contain at least 8 characters.\n- Should include at least one uppercase letter.\n- Should include at least one lowercase letter.\n- Should include at least one number.\n- Cannot be identical to the previous password.\n\nTo proceed, please ensure your password meets these criteria before attempting to set it again. If you continue to experience issues, we recommend resetting your password using the process outlined in our article titled \"Password Reset\" [1]. This should help resolve any problems you're encountering.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]\nCloudDesk Support Agent",
